commit(n,t,ds,ch,items,'A calculation of compatibility of u with iterated divided powers. The page gives alpha_pq=(pq)!/((p!)^q q!) and a square for iteration, with a curved connection to Gamma^q(Gamma^pF(X)). The coefficient is consistent with (x^p/p!)^q/q! divided by x^(pq)/(pq)!, a local rational-coefficient check only. The total map signs are read as stars, using their crossed strokes and the graded-versus-degree-p distinction; H reads them as alpha. Several unclosed or extra parentheses are real and retained. The brace after the composition formula has no detached question dot. The scalar computations at the foot are unfinished; the degree of lambda in the right-hand expression is visibly q, although the left expression has pq. No equality between these incomplete lines is asserted by this transcription. Sheet number 333.',hand=['Crossed total-degree stars are minute and can look like alpha; confirmed at the top map, repeated generator identity and lower monomial. H consistently reads alpha here.','The equals sign abbreviates même in the phrase de = pr; C expanded it.','In the square, eta has a descending stem; the repeated target letter is heavily overwritten.','Two upright short ticks between display lines function as vertical equality marks, not quotation marks.'],notation=[('u_* versus u_p','Total graded map versus degree-p component; star is small and crossed.'),('gamma^{q,p}, alpha_pq','Iteration superscript and its coefficient; order q,p is preserved.'),('de = pr','Equality sign used as a verbal abbreviation.')],abbr=[('pr','pour'),('= (in prose)','même')],checks=[check('332-text-square','Compatibility square and generator identities recorded; incomplete parentheses preserved.'),check('332-note-coefficient','Over Q, (x^p/p!)^q/q! = ((pq)!/((p!)^q q!)) gamma^{pq}(x); coefficient and order checked.','targeted proof check'),check('332-text-scalars','Unfinished scalar formulas not asserted to be equal or proved.')])
